\label{exam_cpexhaustion}
The example applies the $CP$-algorithm from \mbox{Theorem \ref{theor_existencecpexhaustion}} to the free-choice net $N$ underlying the Petri net $(N,\mu_0)$ from Figure \ref{fig_figure5}. The net is taken from \cite{Aal2018}. It is well-formed because $\mu_0$ is live and safe. We construct by iteration \mbox{a $CP$-exhaustion} \mbox{of $N$} adapted to the cluster
$$cl:=span_N<start,\ t_0>.$$
